silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_02_typed_materialization_sections_04_round_trip_repair_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'RoundTripRepairConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the governed Mittens individual — the domestic cat at the Tartu Animal Clinic whose annual vet exam on 2026-05-18 produced the evidence chunk c-0x7f4a; also, the specific Icechunk chunk c-0x7f4a storing the Tartu vet-record payload for Mittens, dated 2026-05-18, with hash sha256:7f4a...bf2c, typed as evidence leg." .
